      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pagosa_Springs%2C_Colorado",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The “Mother” spring feeds hot springs along the upper San Juan River, with water steaming at about 144 °F.",
